# Sample Devices file  the entries are as follows# ID DEVICE - SPEED[-SPEED] DIALER_TO_USE# ID     = Systems file entry for the device table entry# -      = This field will probably hold the port timeout value#          At the moment it is ignored but must contain a -# DEVICE = Serial Port to use# SPEED  = Speed to match from Systems file,  MIN-MAX speeds may be#          used.  This allows different dialers at different speeds# DIALER = Name of the Dialers file entry to use.#MDM1 /t3 - 19200-38400 PPI384MDM1 /t3 - 1200-9600   PPI96TTY1 /t2 - 2400        Direct